OL,3,GNEWSASuperbug study to look at river
OL,4,Apollution link
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers will be analysing rivers in
OL,7,Fnorth-east England as part of a study
OL,8,Finto the link between pollution and
OL,9,Fsuperbugs.
OL,11,FA team from Durham University has
OL,12,Fjoined a project looking at how metals,
OL,13,Fsewage and other pollutants interact in
OL,14,Frivers and if this encourages the
OL,15,Fevolution of drug-resistant bacteria,
OL,16,Fknown as superbugs.
OL,18,FSuperbugs become resistant to
OL,19,Fantibiotics, making infections harder
OL,20,Fto treat. The team will use advanced
OL,21,Fgenetic techniques to study how
OL,22,Fpollution affects them.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
